{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13110030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13110030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"narration:0:1311003001:1":{"text":"瓦丽卡叩响一道暗门，敲击声回荡在废墟中，暗门后却始终无人答应","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C355E31A9E77A0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311003002:1":{"text":"奇怪……她不在吗？唔……或许是在祈祷，没有听见……","source_cn":"奇怪……她不在吗？唔……或许是在祈祷，没有听见……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B0D9E835BD30BFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311003003:1":{"text":"瓦丽卡，这里就是你那位朋友的家？她……住在地道里？","source_cn":"瓦丽卡，这里就是你那位朋友的家？她……住在地道里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21542DB3224C6381","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311003004:1":{"text":"没错。这是卡列琳娜——我这位朋友——的家，这里以前是她家的宅邸。她的家族……曾是这里的三大贵族之一。","source_cn":"没错。这是卡列琳娜——我这位朋友——的家，这里以前是她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86FB840E006C8FD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311003005:1":{"text":"曾是……那现在呢？","source_cn":"曾是……那现在呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C6C24FEAA3B42C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311003006:1":{"text":"现在……和这片废墟一样死去，腐朽，然后被遗忘了。","source_cn":"现在……和这片废墟一样死去，腐朽，然后被遗忘了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA2508CBF81DDAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311003007:1":{"text":"时间紧迫，不能在外面干等她。跟我来，我们去拿开门用的<style=\"highlight\">亡灵之焰</style>。","source_cn":"时间紧迫，不能在外面干等她。跟我来，我们去拿开门用的<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6ADE54F8520C818","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1311003007":{"text":"时间紧迫，不能在外面干等她。跟我来，我们去拿开门用的<style=\"highlight\">亡灵之焰</style>。","source_cn":"时间紧迫，不能在外面干等她。跟我来，我们去拿开门用的<style=highlight>亡灵之焰</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6ADE54F8520C818","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311003008:1":{"text":"就是你们常说的“鬼火”。用亡灵之焰点亮门上的灯盏，就可以打开这扇暗门。","source_cn":"就是你们常说的“鬼火”。用亡灵之焰点亮门上的灯盏，就可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE5301519580D6CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311003011:1":{"text":"呃，看来“亡灵之焰”就是开门用的钥匙，放钥匙的地方离这里远吗？","source_cn":"呃，看来“亡灵之焰”就是开门用的钥匙，放钥匙的地方离这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B7FC1EE0D708E34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311003012:1":{"text":"卡列琳娜对这座宅邸充满感情，一直不曾远离此地。打开暗门的“钥匙”当然也在宅邸废墟中。","source_cn":"卡列琳娜对这座宅邸充满感情，一直不曾远离此地。打开暗门...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD4B87730DBE4647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1311003013:1":{"text":"呃……满满有个问题，把暗门的钥匙放在别人能拿到的地方，不就失去了锁门的意义了吗？","source_cn":"呃……满满有个问题，把暗门的钥匙放在别人能拿到的地方，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87894E1EB3886B21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311003014:1":{"text":"其实，“锁门”毫无意义。在生前或许需要，但对我们这样先死去，又苟活了很久的人来说，钱财早已失去它的价值，也没什么可丢失的了。","source_cn":"其实，“锁门”毫无意义。在生前或许需要，但对我们这样先...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67962D86FFC08358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1311003015:1":{"text":"你亲眼看着认识的人渐渐死去，周围一切慢慢变得陌生，最后毫无关联。你无法融入世界，只能活在过往的废墟中，回忆，然后忍受回忆带来的折磨……","source_cn":"你亲眼看着认识的人渐渐死去，周围一切慢慢变得陌生，最后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFD46CE06AC51C00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1311003016:1":{"text":"更何况，这里的人们害怕我们、诅咒和远离我们。哈……他们根本不会靠近这里，更别提来偷盗或者抢劫了。","source_cn":"更何况，这里的人们害怕我们、诅咒和远离我们。哈……他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA12522342DA585","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","documen